/*
  # Seed the standard component library

  Frozen source of truth — the generator script was removed; if the rows
  must change, edit the rows here, or regenerate by hand from componentLibrary.ts.

  The components table is RLS-protected: clients may only insert their own
  components (`auth.uid() = user_id`), so the shared standard library —
  deliberately `user_id NULL, is_standard true` — can only be installed by
  a superuser, i.e. here. A client-side seed was shipped originally and
  failed with 403/400 on every deployment, leaving the library empty.

  Wrapped in `where not exists`: applies only to a deployment whose
  standard library is still empty. Never re-seeds, never overwrites custom
  components, never duplicates.
*/

